nt Services Immigrant Information & Resources Veterans Support Campus Safety Transportation & Parking Campus Events Commencement OAKtoberFest TEDxMenlo College Search Visit MyMenlo GIVE APPLY Athletics Parents & Families Alumni Current Students GIVE APPLY BACK TO TOP Internships and Career Services Internships and Career Services The mission of Internships and Career Services (ICS) is to empower all students and alumni to achieve their professional goals; and to mobilize students, alumni, staff, faculty, and employers to act as the core of the Menlo College network that champions opportunities for career exploration, career competency development, and experiential learning. Students Employers Alumni Menlo's Annual Career Connect Day and Career Fair Learn More Contact Career Services LaShonda Kennedy Executive Director of Career Services and Student Engagement lashonda.kennedy@menlo.edu Elijah Valdeolivar Senior Associate Director of Employer Relations & Career Services elijah.valdeolivar@menlo.edu Internships and Career Services (ICS) Schedule an Appointment Note: you will need to log in to Handshake careerservices@menlo.edu Your Journey Begins Here Apply Contact Menlo 1000 El Camino Real, Atherton, CA 94027 650-543-3753 admissions@menlo.edu Menlo News Menlo College Magazine For the Media Title IX Campus Safety Employment Opportunities Privacy Policy Consumer Information Conference Services Summer Internship Housing Menlo College is committed to ensuring equal access and opportunity to all members of our campus community. We do not unlawfully discriminate in hiring, personnel practices, compensation, promotion, access to programs and activities, or educational opportunities on the basis of race, color, marital status, age, creed, national origin, sex, religion, family care status, physical or mental disability, medical condition, reproductive health decision-making, ancestry, military or veteran status, sexual orientation, gender identity, gender expression, citizen